Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.17,0:02:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.54,0:02:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,ComiMa again, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.71,0:02:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you be back by this time tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.30,0:02:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.80,0:02:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I know! Kurisu, you come too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.89,0:02:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really like crowded places.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.14,0:02:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be that crowded on the second day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.85,0:02:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You should come too, Okarin...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.65,0:02:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe, come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.70,0:03:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.03,0:03:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since you got back, you've been looking down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.37,0:03:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you tell Mayuri is trying to cheer you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.92,0:03:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.58,0:03:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.75,0:03:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stay calm!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.80,0:03:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow is the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.80,0:03:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if she's safe today, tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.35,0:03:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times have I talked to you about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.39,0:03:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.19,0:03:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I want to tell you.
