Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.37,0:03:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri is going to die tomorrow?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.91,0:03:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Most likely, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.25,0:03:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,At first, it was the night of the 13th.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.92,0:03:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But each time I undid a D-Mail, it happened one day later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.97,0:04:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to go with her to ComiMa tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.76,0:04:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a way to save her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.77,0:04:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to wait for her to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.60,0:04:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.31,0:04:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to know the precise deadline in this worldline.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.40,0:04:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, I can time leap back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.91,0:04:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.12,0:04:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The next one to undo
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.70,0:04:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,is that Kiryu Moeka person's, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.87,0:04:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.96,0:04:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what she sent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.04,0:04:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,She sent a message
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.38,0:04:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,telling herself not to buy a new cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.30,0:04:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, I need to send it from her phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.30,0:04:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You go find her...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.31,0:04:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go with Mayuri to ComiMa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.48,0:04:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.23,0:04:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If all goes well,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.61,0:04:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I can protect Mayuri before she—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.61,0:04:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.15,0:04:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't find Moeka, you'll—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.65,0:05:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll contact you right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.49,0:05:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And you can tell me anything, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.99,0:05:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter when, come talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. You're still...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.96,0:05:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what worldline you're in, you aren't alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.51,0:05:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.31,0:05:28.77,CellyTitle,,0,0,0,,{\fs21\c&H2B2B2A&\be2\pos(933,351)\frx18\fry8\frz6.851}Assistant
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.98,0:05:38.48,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs90\be6\frx8\fry356\frz346.516\c&H797474&\move(1197,484,1341,198,27,6492)}From: {\c&HFFFFFF&}Assistant
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.98,0:05:38.48,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs90\be6\frx8\fry356\frz345.761\move(1291.5,664.5,1432.5,375,0,6488)}Now in Ariake
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.44,0:05:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm in Ariake now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.02,0:05:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Too many people here...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.57,0:05:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Way more than I expected.{（￣д￣；； }
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.07,0:05:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Save me!{orz}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.70,0:05:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{i\1}No response from Moeka, but I found her workplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.53,0:05:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.54,0:05:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.66,0:05:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.75,0:05:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiryu Moeka?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.54,0:06:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, that girl worked here two or three days and quit. That was her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.76,0:06:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Her address?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.09,0:06:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I have it, but who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.44,0:06:13.39,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.05\c&H454545&\frz8.219\frx4\fry346\pos(972,786)\fax-.1}Heights White
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.02,0:06:16.19,Pencil,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.125\frz34.999\c&H7A7875&\pos(738,772.5)\fax.1}Heights White
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.02,0:06:16.19,Pencil,,0,0,0,,{\c&H736F6B&\blur1.125\frz35.03\pos(1684.5,1026)\fax.1}Kiryu Moeka
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.78,0:06:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.90,0:06:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.91,0:06:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiryu Moeka...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.24,0:06:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,She killed herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.99,0:06:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.37,0:06:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.95,0:06:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,When?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.00,0:06:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.29,0:06:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The body was taken to Chiyoda Hospital 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.21,0:06:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}She doesn't seem to have any relatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.67,0:06:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.93,0:06:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.18,0:06:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.93,0:06:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.73,0:06:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did her companions kill her
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.06,0:06:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}before she could kill Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.73,0:06:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.23,0:07:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the reason doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.28,0:07:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}At this rate, Mayuri will...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.37,0:07:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A time leap...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.49,0:07:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to time leap to before Moeka dies!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.97,0:07:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.22,0:07:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Oka... Okabe!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.81,0:07:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.10,0:07:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mayuri... Mayuri...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.90,0:07:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The deadline is 7:52 PM.{19:52}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.57,0:07:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.16,0:07:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.41,0:07:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you eat this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.12,0:07:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the label!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.58,0:07:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It says "Makise" right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.79,0:07:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.33,0:08:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.17,0:08:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You aren't alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.21,0:08:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.46,0:08:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, Kurisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.30,0:08:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.68,0:08:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know a girl named Kiryu Moeka?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.93,0:08:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.22,0:08:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I just did a time leap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.73,0:08:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.44,0:08:25.69,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.05\c&H454545&\frz8.219\frx4\fry346\pos(972,786)\fax-.1}Heights White
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.35,0:08:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,FB...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.52,0:09:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,FB...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.15,0:09:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,FB...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.94,0:09:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.48,0:09:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.40,0:09:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,FB...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.07,0:09:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.57,0:09:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't you message me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.24,0:09:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.08,0:09:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,FB...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.75,0:09:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiryu Moeka.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.17,0:09:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I did what you wanted, so why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.13,0:09:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Okabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.21,0:09:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Give me your orders, FB!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.05,0:09:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.35,0:09:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,FB...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.31,0:09:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,FB...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.47,0:09:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,FB...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.93,0:09:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,FB...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.31,0:09:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No! No! No! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.67,0:10:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll never...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.54,0:10:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}forgive...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.42,0:10:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}her!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.31,0:10:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,G-Give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.73,0:10:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.06,0:10:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.86,0:10:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.90,0:10:28.69,CellyTitle,,0,0,0,,{\frz25.973\c&HB4B0B3&\3c&HB4B0B3&\blur6\bord1.5\t(667,774,\fscy60\fscx60)\move(1000.5,504,1060.5,468,667,774)}Okabe Rintaro
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.90,0:10:28.69,CellyTitle,,0,0,0,,{\frz25.973\c&HB4B0B3&\be6\t(667,774,\fscy60\fscx60)\move(1000.5,504,1060.5,468,667,774)}Okabe Rintaro
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.86,0:10:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Makise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.82,0:10:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get the phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.53,0:10:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I stole it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.44,0:10:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare the D-Mail!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.82,0:10:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.57,0:10:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.32,0:10:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.36,0:10:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.32,0:10:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,More importantly, what about Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.45,0:10:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,She's in Braun's TV Workshop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.87,0:10:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The 42" is on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.83,0:10:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurisu! Activate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.75,0:10:46.63,Celly2,,0,0,0,,{\fs67.5\an4\be3\frz332.67\c&HE4E1E2&\pos(187.5,475.5)}Change your phone. It will sell out soon,\Nand you won't be able to get one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.00,0:10:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.46,0:10:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.05,0:10:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.84,0:10:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If I send this, Mayuri will...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.82,0:11:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back! Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.91,0:11:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back my phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.36,0:11:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.57,0:11:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.16,0:11:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.04,0:11:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you send it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.99,0:11:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.83,0:11:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it working?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.16,0:11:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw the electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.79,0:11:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.58,0:11:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Reading Steiner didn't activate!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.25,0:11:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Reading Steiner didn't activate...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.26,0:11:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.05,0:11:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back! Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.97,0:11:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.56,0:11:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back! Give it back! Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.35,0:11:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't working!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.44,0:11:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,A D-Mail has different effects depending on who it was sent to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.69,0:11:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this mean your message won't change her actions?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.78,0:11:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.58,0:12:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't change.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.21,0:12:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She didn't change her cell phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.96,0:12:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.17,0:12:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You confirmed it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.01,0:12:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I changed my cell phone four days ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.51,0:12:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and I want to tell myself not to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.72,0:12:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,She sent another right after that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.85,0:12:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But that means we don't know what was in that D-Mail!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.02,0:12:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be in her outbox!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.44,0:12:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll look...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.90,0:12:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.11,0:12:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Okabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.66,0:12:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.57,0:12:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to call you back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.91,0:12:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.20,0:12:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.75,0:12:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.42,0:12:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.83,0:12:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.55,0:13:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you doing over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.30,0:13:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.02,0:13:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back! Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.08,0:13:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, what are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.59,0:13:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.93,0:13:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously! Couples these days...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.97,0:13:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.70,0:14:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I have to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.91,0:14:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I have to do for you to give it back?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.46,0:14:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember sending a D-Mail?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.09,0:14:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A D— What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.97,0:14:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Two weeks ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.51,0:14:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,you should have received a strange message
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.55,0:14:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,from your future self.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.85,0:14:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.93,0:14:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what it said, and I'll give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.19,0:14:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Can't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.36,0:14:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it have something to do with the IBN 5100?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,With the Rounders?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.53,0:14:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.74,0:14:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me! What did it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.95,0:14:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want your cell phone back?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.87,0:14:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't betray them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.79,0:14:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.79,0:14:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That FB person?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.08,0:15:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I get my orders from FB.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.55,0:15:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,FB is everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.88,0:15:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's your leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.76,0:15:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't betray FB?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.68,0:15:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's great that you're so loyal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.60,0:15:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.77,0:15:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,they don't give a damn about what happens to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.77,0:15:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll abandon you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.86,0:15:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.28,0:15:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They haven't contacted you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.16,0:15:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been betrayed. Cut off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.29,0:15:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.08,0:15:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,FB isn't like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.17,0:15:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,FB saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.88,0:15:46.34,Celly3,,0,0,0,,{\c&H222253&\blur4.5\pos(414,105)}...in Cabinet Office...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.88,0:15:46.34,Celly3,,0,0,0,,{\be5\c&H4F866A&\pos(411,100.5)}...in Cabinet Office...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.76,0:15:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been used!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.37,0:16:15.33,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\be3\frx6\fry2\c&H8D8889&\frz343.244\t(0,3951,\fscy130\fscx130)\move(1153.5,447,1080,597,0,3951)}Rounder Recruitment
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.66,0:16:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know why you can tell me these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.58,0:16:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,FB is like a mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.29,0:16:21.75,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs172.5\blur4.5\frz16.3\c&H403838&\pos(1189.999,277)\fax.05}Subject: {\c&HBCBCBC&}A Question
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.29,0:16:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What kind of job is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.92,0:16:27.22,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs90\blur3\pos(1617,244.5)}Re: A Question
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.63,0:16:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a type of time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.46,0:16:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The message from the future is proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.22,0:16:29.18,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs180\blur3\frz337.944\pos(1270.5,546)\c&HC5C5C5&\frx8\fry0\fax-.17}Another Question
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.55,0:16:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can I do it too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.34,0:16:33.14,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs67.5\blur2.25\pos(615,240)}Re: Another Question
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.34,0:16:33.14,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs67.5\blur2.25\pos(841.5,553.5)}Of course. We offer everyone \Nthe job that best suits them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.39,0:16:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They needed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.81,0:16:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've never worked before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.85,0:16:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't have skills or anything I'm good at.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.60,0:16:38.81,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs112.5\blur4.5\c&H989898&\pos(222,127.5)}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.81,0:16:42.27,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs112.5\blur4.5\c&H989898&\pos(616.5,124.5)}Let's do our best together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.11,0:16:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've seen it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.66,0:16:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.08,0:16:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.37,0:17:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You will kill yourself in this room four days from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.71,0:17:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll die here alone, still waiting to hear from FB!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.05,0:17:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.93,0:17:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.35,0:17:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never hear from FB again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.35,0:17:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.89,0:17:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lie...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.43,0:17:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How long has it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.48,0:17:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.56,0:17:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been waiting a while, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.40,0:17:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think that's strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.24,0:17:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to die right here,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.82,0:17:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.57,0:17:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,in this dark, empty room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.03,0:17:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.58,0:17:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You killed Mayuri, and now {\i1}you'll{\i0} die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.20,0:17:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Alone and betrayed like the\N worthless piece of trash you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.37,0:17:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.79,0:17:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to kill yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.29,0:17:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and nobody will save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.34,0:17:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even FB!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.84,0:18:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.84,0:18:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You said FB was like a mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.55,0:18:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is FB a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.02,0:18:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.56,0:18:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.10,0:18:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We've never met.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.60,0:18:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to meet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.11,0:18:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If I did, she'd probably hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.15,0:18:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,From the look of it, I bet you've never spoken by phone either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.12,0:18:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm amazed you did anything they ordered!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.37,0:19:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They gave me a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.45,0:19:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A place?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.30,0:19:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're... a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.64,0:19:18.64,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs180\blur3\pos(837,669)\frz342.834}The retro-PC is
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.64,0:19:19.18,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs135\blur3\c&HBFBBB9&\pos(1524,624)\frx16\fry8\frz30\fax.2}in Yanabayashi Shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.18,0:19:20.64,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs135\blur3\pos(1077,375)\frx12\fry358\frz354.18}Recover it immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.06,0:19:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.60,0:19:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't scare me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.98,0:19:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You were worried about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.77,0:19:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.57,0:19:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.24,0:19:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.15,0:19:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the one who stole the IBN 5100...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.57,0:19:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Moeka.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.74,0:19:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is she now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.74,0:19:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ask any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.54,0:19:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll undo the D-Mail as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.37,0:19:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,July 31st, around 11:00 AM, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.80,0:19:58.26,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs195\blur3\pos(987,933)}Don't go to the shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.05,0:20:01.26,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs195\blur3\an6\pos(1884,768)}It's a trap. It isn't there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.18,0:20:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.93,0:20:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This time...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.20,0:20:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.24,0:20:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.37,0:20:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.83,0:20:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kiryu Moeka from the past didn't believe the D-Mail?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.33,0:20:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,She believed the first one, just in case?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.67,0:20:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You could try another message!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.76,0:20:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.38,0:20:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I think there's only one person she'll follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.89,0:20:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If I send a message from that phone, she'll obey it,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.30,0:20:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter what it says!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.26,0:20:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.44,0:20:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to look for FB.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.44,0:20:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have any clues...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.49,0:21:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you do, you won't tell me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.03,0:21:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Earlier, you were saying
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.66,0:21:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,that I killed someone. Is that in the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.70,0:21:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.83,0:21:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd do it if FB ordered you to, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.29,0:21:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I would. Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.63,0:21:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you knew you were being used?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.34,0:21:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to die, abandoned and waiting...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.09,0:21:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Four days. August 15th.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.06,0:21:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The world itself has decided that you will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.93,0:21:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's inevitable,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.10,0:21:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,but I won't let it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.98,0:21:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fight the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.24,0:21:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and I {\i1}will{\i0} save Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.25,0:21:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The coin locker...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.38,0:22:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,in front of Daibiru.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.68,0:22:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The IBN 5100...
